  "shortDescription": "UENI is a done-for-you website service for local small businesses — custom-designed site, domain, hosting, SSL, business email, basic ecommerce/booking, and human support. US pricing (2026-08-19): Launch $79 one-time setup + $24.99/month; Plus (most popular) $59/month with unlimited concierge edits; Growth $124.99/month with 1-on-1 marketing; Ecommerce tier $99/month on published US grid. 30-day money-back guarantee. 0% transaction fee on published ecommerce tiers. Website-builder-commerce cluster peer of Wegic — not a Shopify-class commerce OS.",
